                Clean around them carefully.

            </p>

        </article>



        <article class="tip-card">

            <div class="tip-icon">
                👩‍⚕️
            </div>

            <h3>
                Ask a professional
            </h3>

            <p>

                SmileCare is an educational project.
                A dentist or orthodontist can provide
                personalized advice.

            </p>

        </article>


    </div>

</section>



<!-- =================================
     FOOTER
================================= -->

<footer>

    <strong>
        SmileCare
    </strong>

    — Interactive Oral Health Education.

    <br><br>

    This website provides general educational
    information and does not replace professional
    dental or orthodontic advice.

</footer>


</main>



